<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's wholesale price up 0.4 pct in November.</title>
<headline>Morocco's wholesale price up 0.4 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Wholesale Price Index (WPI) rose 0.4 percent in November to 357.4 from 356.2 in October, the Statistics Directorate said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The rise was due mainly to the price increase of industrial products by 0.6 percent, the directorate said.</p>
<p>    MOROCCO WHOLESALE PRICES     Nov 96	Oct 96</p>
<p>    Index				357.4	  356.2</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (percent)	 0.4	   00</p>
<p>Note - Wholesale prices in Jan-Nov were up 4.9 percent from the same period last year.</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
